To build a particular service
==============================
mvn clean install -pl services/p-cscf/ -am
mvn clean install -pl services/i-cscf/ -am
mvn clean install -pl services/c-cscf/ -am
mvn clean install -pl services/hss/ -am

These will each indiviadually build its own jar binary


Disable and enable registry
===========================
microk8s disable registry && microk8s enable registry

Check if all repository are cleared
===================================
until curl -s --max-time 2 http://localhost:32000/v2/_catalog 2>/dev/null | grep -q repositories; do sleep 2; done; curl -s http://localhost:32000/v2/_catalog
{"repositories":[]}

repositories":[] - means eveything is cleared


Push all in one go
===================
for t in ims/hss:20092026 ims/i-cscf:22092026 ims/s-cscf:29092026 ims/p-cscf:29092026_2; do docker push localhost:32000/$t; done


To create a docker image
=========================
docker build -t localhost:32000/ims/p-cscf:29092026 services/p-cscf
The above command will build docker based on the docker file in the folder services/p-cscf
with tag 29092026

This is will created locally

To push the docker image to local registry
===========================================
docker push localhost:32000/ims/p-cscf:29092026


